  Skeleton by the harness owner (the facts' interface); stage 1 (T05b1)
  writes ByteToUnicode, CreateFromVocab/Init, PreTokenize and the
  properties, stage 2 (T05b2) EncodeWord, Encode, Decode, SpecialId and
